{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Lenovo Device Health\n---\n\nWelcome to the Lenovo Device Health workbook. This workbook will help \n\n- Identify the status of updates that have been installed by Commercial Vantage or Lenovo Client Update on your endpoints\n- View battery health\n- Check warranty expiration\n- Find devices that have stopped reporting\n- Review systems with active [CVEs](https://support.lenovo.com/product_security/ps500001-lenovo-product-security-advisories)\n\nVisit the [Lenovo Support Site](https://pcsupport.lenovo.com/) for the latest drivers, BIOS, and firmware.",
        "style": "info"
      },
      "name": "Title"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
